Package: treemmm
Type: Package
Title: Tree-Based Marketing Mix Modeling with SHAP Attribution
Version: 0.2.1.9000
Date: 2026-05-11
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Young",
           email = "james.young@ucb.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tree-based Marketing Mix Modeling (MMM) using gradient-boosted
    trees (LightGBM, XGBoost) paired with SHAP attribution for promotional
    channel decomposition on customer-level panel data. Automatically
    discovers non-linear response functions, channel interactions, and
    heterogeneous customer sensitivity without requiring the analyst to
    pre-specify functional forms. R port of the Python implementation;
    see <https://github.com/jamesyoung93/treemmm> for the original package
    and accompanying paper.
